{%- capture subject -%}Your trial ends on {{ subscription.trial_end }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture html -%}
<p>Hello{% if customer.name %} {{ customer.name }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>Your {{ merchant.name }} trial ({{ subscription.plan }}) ends on {{ subscription.trial_end }}.</p>
{% if subscription.with_card %}<p><strong>When the trial ends, on {{ subscription.trial_end }}, {{ subscription.first_charge }} will be charged to your saved card</strong>, and your subscription renews every period. If you do not want to continue, you can cancel at any time before then; you will not be charged.</p>{% else %}<p>To keep your subscription, add a payment method before the trial ends. Otherwise your subscription ends with the trial and you are not charged.</p>{% endif %}
{% if portal_url %}<p><a href="{{ portal_url }}">{% if subscription.with_card %}Cancel my subscription{% else %}Add a payment method{% endif %}</a></p>{% endif %}
<p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">You receive this email because of your subscription with {{ merchant.name }}.</p>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture text -%}
Hello{% if customer.name %} {{ customer.name }}{% endif %},

Your {{ merchant.name }} trial ({{ subscription.plan }}) ends on {{ subscription.trial_end }}.

{% if subscription.with_card %}When the trial ends, on {{ subscription.trial_end }}, {{ subscription.first_charge }} will be charged to your saved card, and your subscription renews every period. If you do not want to continue, you can cancel at any time before then; you will not be charged.{% else %}To keep your subscription, add a payment method before the trial ends. Otherwise your subscription ends with the trial and you are not charged.{% endif %}

{% if portal_url %}{% if subscription.with_card %}Cancel my subscription{% else %}Add a payment method{% endif %}: {{ portal_url }}

{% endif %}You receive this email because of your subscription with {{ merchant.name }}.
{%- endcapture -%}
